OL,3,GNEWSAThird charge after police officer
OL,4,Ashot in Nottingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third person has been charged after a
OL,7,Fpolice officer was shot in Nottingham
OL,8,Fcity centre.
OL,10,FLea Anderson, of Commercial Road in
OL,11,FNottingham, has been charged with
OL,12,Fpossession of a firearm to endanger
OL,13,Flife, possession of a firearm with
OL,14,Fintent to cause fear of violence, and
OL,15,Fpossession of a prohibited weapon.
OL,17,FThe 31-year-old has been remanded into
OL,18,Fcustody and will appear before
OL,19,FNottingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,20,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
