OL,3,GNEWSAThird charge after police officer
OL,4,Ashot in Nottingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Lee Lane was shot in the foot after
OL,7,Fapproaching two suspects at a bus stop
OL,8,Fin Angel Row shortly before 04:50 BST
OL,9,Fon 18 October. He remains in hospital
OL,10,Freceiving treatment.
